  /* Named only after the division is visible, and named the way the
     site writes anything else: sentence case in the UI sans, small
     enough to stay well under the realisation below but set to be read
     at arm's length rather than squinted at. The illustration behind
     them is detailed, so each word sits on a small near-white ground
     of its own — no border, no shadow, no glow. Quiet, but readable
     first: a word you have to hunt for is not a label. */
  .dy-hero__zt-s3-tag {
    position: absolute;
    margin: 0;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    padding: 0.34em 0.46em;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--sans);
